Inkling-2-Small EXL3 — the serving stack
Copyright 2026 the Inkling-2-Small EXL3 contributors

This repository bundles:

- engine/ — TensorFold, the native inference engine.
  Copyright 2026 TensorFold contributors. Apache License 2.0 (see engine/LICENSE,
  engine/NOTICE, engine/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). Source: https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold
  This copy is the tree the deployed binary was built from (version 1.2.7 plus the
  unreleased inkling2 family and the EXL3 lane); it is vendored because the inkling2
  family is not in a tagged upstream release.

- gateway/ — the Anthropic/OpenAI gateway in front of the engine.
  Copyright 2026 the Inkling-2-Small EXL3 contributors. Apache License 2.0.
  Derived in part from vLLM's Anthropic Messages serving layer (Apache-2.0).

- scripts/, config/, tests/ — the serving stack. Apache License 2.0.

Model weights are NOT in this repository. They are downloaded from Hugging Face:
  - kortexa-ai/Inkling-2-Small-EXL3-2.59bpw (Apache-2.0) — the EXL3 expert export
  - thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Small (Apache-2.0) — the native release (NVFP4/MXFP8)
See docs/weights.md for the full list, including the two q6 packs published at
myanvoos/Inkling-2-Small-EXL3-Sparks (derived works of the release, Apache-2.0).
